    "Generator refines externally tagged Result map cardinality and the current envelope profile; conditional schema metadata reflects the real native-pairing false-SMS-consent decoder. Duplicate metadata/discriminator keys remain byte-level parser constraints rather than invented parsed-JSON schema guarantees.",
    "Generated synthetic dispatch catalog records shape/dispatch examples only, without presenting them as business-valid calls or authorization. All generation inputs are hashed and checked unchanged. Endpoint inventory adds the consolidated reference without claiming runtime coverage."
  ],
